          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 131820,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esploriamo come usare <code>continue</code>, <code>break</code> ed <code>else</code> per controllare il flusso del ciclo, saltare iterazioni, uscire in anticipo o eseguire il codice dopo il ciclo.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2 - Copy",
            "id": 131844,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>continue</code> viene usato per saltare il blocco corrente e passare all'iterazione successiva.</p><p>Assicurati di non stampare il numero <code>2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i == \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"continue\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>==</code>, seguito da <code>continue</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>continue</code> viene usato per saltare il blocco corrente e passare all'iterazione successiva.</p><p>Nel confronto, metti <code>i</code> a sinistra e il numero a destra.</p><p>Fai stampare al ciclo <code>1</code>, <code>3</code>, <code>4</code> e <code>5</code> saltando l'iterazione per <code>2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i == \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"continue\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>i</code>, seguito da <code>==</code>, <code>2</code> e infine <code>continue</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 131821,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa <code>continue</code> per saltare elementi specifici, come <code>\"chips\"</code>, in un ciclo e passare all'iterazione successiva.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;apples&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bananas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bread&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chips&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shopping_list:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item == \" /><text value=\"&quot;chips&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"continue\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Don't forget to buy: \" /><text value=\"{item}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"126\" endIndex=\"134\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Don't forget to buy: apples\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Don't forget to buy: bananas\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Don't forget to buy: bread\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Don't forget to buy: milk\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Don't forget to buy: eggs\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>continue</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3 - Copy",
            "id": 131845,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'istruzione <code>break</code> esce completamente dal ciclo. Se viene invocata, non esegue le iterazioni rimanenti.</p><p>Aggiungiamo un'istruzione <code>break</code> al programma per interrompere il ciclo quando <code>i</code> diventa <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i == \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>==</code>, seguito da <code>break</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'istruzione <code>break</code> esce completamente dal ciclo. Se viene invocata, non esegue le iterazioni rimanenti.</p><p>Nel confronto, metti <code>i</code> a sinistra e il numero a destra.</p><p>Fai stampare al ciclo <code>1</code>, <code>2</code> e <code>3</code>, poi interrompilo prima che stampi <code>4</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"range\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>i</code>, seguito da <code>==</code>, <code>4</code> e infine <code>break</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 131823,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare la parola chiave <code>break</code> per uscire da un ciclo <code>while</code> se viene soddisfatta una determinata condizione, ad esempio una password corrispondente.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"password = \" /><text value=\"&quot;open_sesame&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" input(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enter the password: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") == password:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Access granted!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Incorrect password. Try again.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"119\" endIndex=\"124\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Incorrect password. Try again.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Incorrect password. Try again.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Access granted!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>break</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 131825,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Infine, l'istruzione <code>else</code> nei cicli viene eseguita quando il ciclo è terminato. Ricorda che <code>else</code> in un ciclo è diverso da <code>else</code> in un'istruzione <code>if</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"'Loop has ended'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Loop has ended\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>else</code>, seguito da <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'istruzione <code>else</code> nei cicli viene eseguita quando il ciclo è terminato.</p><p>Ricorda, <code>else</code> in un ciclo è diverso da <code>else</code> in un'istruzione <code>if</code>.</p><p>Completa il ramo finale affinché il programma stampi <code>Loop has ended</code> dopo tutti e cinque i numeri.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"'Loop has ended'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"break\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'Loop is running'\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Loop has ended\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>else</code>, seguito da <code>:</code>, <code>print</code> e infine <code>'Loop has ended'</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 131826,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il blocco <code>else</code> verrà eseguito solo se il ciclo non viene terminato anticipatamente da un'istruzione <code>break</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i == \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loop has ended.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"62\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>break</code>, seguito da <code>else:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il blocco <code>else</code> verrà eseguito solo se il ciclo non viene terminato anticipatamente da un'istruzione <code>break</code>.</p><p>Fermati prima di <code>8</code> in modo che il programma stampi i numeri da <code>1</code> a <code>7</code> senza il messaggio di completamento.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"range\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loop has ended.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>==</code>, seguito da <code>8</code>, <code>break</code> e infine <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 131868,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi la parola chiave mancante per stampare un'istruzione finale dopo che il ciclo ha esaminato tutti gli elementi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shows = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;The Office&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dexter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Friends&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" show \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shows:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(show)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Those are my favorite shows!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"break\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"The Office\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Dexter\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Friends\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Those are my favorite shows!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Stampa ogni serie, poi stampa <code>Those are my favorite shows!</code> soltanto dopo che il ciclo ha esaminato l'intero elenco.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shows = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;The Office&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dexter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Friends&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" show \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shows:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(show)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Those are my favorite shows!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"shows\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"break\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"The Office\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Dexter\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Friends\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Those are my favorite shows!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>show</code>, seguito da <code>else</code> e infine <code>\"Those are my favorite shows!\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 131869,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale parola chiave salta il resto dell'iterazione corrente e avvia l'iterazione successiva?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>continue</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>break</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>continue</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un ciclo trova un'attività completata. Deve saltare il resto dell'iterazione, ma controllare quelle successive. Quale parola chiave serve?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>continue</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>break</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>else</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>continue</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 131870,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assicurati di non elaborare le attività completate.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;pending&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;completed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;pending&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;pending&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"index = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" index &lt; len(tasks):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks[index] == \" /><text value=\"&quot;completed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Skipping task \" /><text value=\"{index + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    index += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"continue\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Processing task \" /><text value=\"{index + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  index += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"185\" endIndex=\"193\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"break\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Processing task 1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Skipping task 2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Processing task 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Processing task 4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>continue</code>.</p></body></html>",
